---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About us" description="Chemi-Core API is a pharmaceutical indenting house in Lahore connecting global API, excipient and packaging manufacturers with pharmaceutical plants across Pakistan." page="about">
  <section class="ph navy">
    <div class="lat"><svg><rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#hx)"/></svg></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="crumb fi"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>About</span></div>
      <h1 class="split">The bridge between global makers and local plants.</h1>
      <p class="lead fi" style="--d:600ms">Chemi-Core API is a fast-growing pharmaceutical indenting house, built on industry expertise and a well-established supplier network.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="intro" data-r>We source <b>premium raw materials, excipients and packaging</b> from reputable manufacturers worldwide, so companies across <b>Pakistan</b> always have what their production depends on.</p>
      <div class="bridge" data-r style="--rd:100ms">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 900 260" role="img" aria-label="Diagram: suppliers connect through Chemi-Core API to pharmaceutical plants">
          <path id="b1" class="ln" d="M210 55C300 55 300 130 375 130"/><path id="b2" class="ln" d="M210 130H375"/><path id="b3" class="ln" d="M210 205C300 205 300 130 375 130"/>
          <path id="b4" class="ln" d="M525 130C615 130 615 55 690 55"/><path id="b5" class="ln" d="M525 130H690"/><path id="b6" class="ln" d="M525 130C615 130 615 205 690 205"/>
          <circle class="pk" r="5"><animateMotion dur="2.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#b1"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="pk" r="5"><animateMotion dur="2.6s" begin="-.9s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#b2"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="pk" r="5"><animateMotion dur="2.6s" begin="-1.7s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#b3"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="pk" r="5"><animateMotion dur="2.6s" begin="-.4s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#b4"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="pk" r="5"><animateMotion dur="2.6s" begin="-1.3s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#b5"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <circle class="pk" r="5"><animateMotion dur="2.6s" begin="-2.1s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#b6"/></animateMotion></circle>
          <rect class="node" x="20" y="28" width="190" height="54" rx="14"/><text class="ns" x="38" y="49">SUPPLIER</text><text class="nt" x="38" y="68">API manufacturers</text>
          <rect class="node" x="20" y="103" width="190" height="54" rx="14"/><text class="ns" x="38" y="124">SUPPLIER</text><text class="nt" x="38" y="143">Excipient producers</text>
          <rect class="node" x="20" y="178" width="190" height="54" rx="14"/><text class="ns" x="38" y="199">SUPPLIER</text><text class="nt" x="38" y="218">Packaging mills</text>
          <rect class="hp" x="375" y="80" width="150" height="100" rx="20"/>
          <rect class="hub" x="375" y="80" width="150" height="100" rx="20"/><text class="hs" x="450" y="117" text-anchor="middle">INDENTING</text><text class="ht" x="450" y="140" text-anchor="middle">Chemi-Core</text><text class="hs" x="450" y="160" text-anchor="middle">LAHORE</text>
          <rect class="node" x="690" y="28" width="190" height="54" rx="14"/><text class="ns" x="708" y="49">CLIENT</text><text class="nt" x="708" y="68">Tablet &amp; capsule plants</text>
          <rect class="node" x="690" y="103" width="190" height="54" rx="14"/><text class="ns" x="708" y="124">CLIENT</text><text class="nt" x="708" y="143">Syrup &amp; liquid lines</text>
          <rect class="node" x="690" y="178" width="190" height="54" rx="14"/><text class="ns" x="708" y="199">CLIENT</text><text class="nt" x="708" y="218">Injectable units</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap stack">
      <article class="scard s1" style="--i:0"><span class="tag">Overview</span><h3>Built on industry expertise.</h3><p>We bridge the gap between international suppliers and pharmaceutical manufacturers, with efficiency and reliability at every step of the procurement cycle.</p></article>
      <article class="scard s2" style="--i:1"><span class="tag">Operations</span><h3>Focused on Pakistan.</h3><p>We work closely with manufacturers and trusted suppliers so our clients have consistent access to the essential materials their production depends on.</p></article>
      <article class="scard s3" style="--i:2"><span class="tag">Expertise</span><h3>Quality-assured, fairly priced.</h3><p>In-depth sector knowledge and an established supplier network let us deliver quality-assured materials at competitive prices, on time.</p></article>
      <article class="scard s4" style="--i:3"><span class="tag">Commitment</span><h3>Partnerships that last.</h3><p>Every transaction is handled with professionalism, transparency and integrity, for clients and suppliers alike.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec bigcta">
    <div class="wrap"><h2 data-r>Talk to our sourcing team.</h2>
      <a class="ring mag" href="/contact/" aria-label="Contact us" data-r style="--rd:150ms"><svg class="txt" viewBox="0 0 190 190" aria-hidden="true"><text><textPath href="#cp">GET IN TOUCH · GET IN TOUCH · GET IN TOUCH · </textPath></text></svg><span class="core"><svg><use href="#arr"/></svg></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
